<div class="zero-container">
    <header class="mb-3">
        <h1>Zero‑Shot Prompting — A Clear, Step‑by‑Step Guide</h1>
        <p class="zero-lead">Learn how to write one simple instruction that a model can follow without any examples. We will define each word, show easy patterns, and practice with small tasks.</p>
    </header>

    <nav class="zero-toc">
        <div class="zero-fw-semibold mb-2">On this page</div>
        <ol>
            <li><a href="#intro">1) What is Zero‑Shot?</a></li>
